{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00721","headline":"郊庙歌辞 让皇帝庙乐章 奠币 · 李舒","name":"郊庙歌辞 让皇帝庙乐章 奠币","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟帝时若，去而上仙。\n祀用商舞，乐备宫悬。\n白璧加荐，玄纁告虔。\n子孙拜後，承兹吉蠲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李舒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}